OL,5,G1600 Police Interceptors
OL,6,     FJim and Lisa direct an
OL,7,     Fintelligence-led strike. Suspects
OL,8,     Fare on the move; it's believed
OL,9,     Fthey're in possession of a handgun
OL,10,     Fand ammunition. The Knife Crime
OL,11,     FTeam target drug hotspots.
OL,12,G1700 Call the Bailiffs: Time to Pay Up
OL,13,     FDocumentary series following the
OL,14,     Fwork of enforcement agents as they
OL,15,     Fexecute High Court Writs on behalf
OL,16,     Fof people desperate to recover
OL,17,     Fmoney they are owed.
OL,18,G1800 Home and Away
OL,19,     FLacey looks to the future. Cash is
OL,20,     Fblindsided by a surprise visitor.
OL,21,     FEden feels out of the loop.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG3/8
