OL,5,G2300 Skin A&E
OL,6,     FDr Toby Nelson checks a patient's
OL,7,     Fback and finds a pre-cancerous
OL,8,     Fmole, Dr Emma McMullen inspects a
OL,9,     Flipoma on a patient's buttock, and
OL,10,     FDr Dev Shah treats a collection of
OL,11,     Fskin tags.
OL,12,G0000 Fare Dodgers: At War with the Law
OL,13,     FTransport for London investigators
OL,14,     Fhunt for a suspected prolific fare
OL,15,     Fevader owing the network almost
OL,16,     F#4k. In Nottingham, revenue
OL,17,     Fprotection agents conduct a plain
OL,18,     Fclothes operation.
